     2) the Reference goes into <m_ReferenceList> (Array_Size 12 -> 13)
     World 3757198404 = 0xdff24c44 = GameBootstrap LoadInfo "AC2MP_ludotest" -> the game loads multi/DataPC_AC2MP_ludotest.forge
     (and hides the entry for players who don't have that file). Unlockable/MpWorld objIDs 0xd7e50010/11 are unused in ACB.
     Name/description strings and both images are San Marco's for now: ACB has no "Dyers" string, and menu images
     must be in a forge that's always loaded (base maps keep theirs in DataPC_extra.forge). -->

